  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Against He Lang Zi as a lightning flash giant wolf, Fang Yuan casts the star path immortal killer move and becomes six figures that fly out, so a lightning beam hits nothing. The six bodies trail blue starlight, encircle the wolf, and attack with mortal killer moves while illusion bodies that die are replaced; six remain on the field even after many kills. He Lang Zi has to defend with immortal killer moves and rank seven immortal essence while Fang Yuan spends primeval essence, and Fang Yuan gains the initiative for the first time in that stretch.",
      "chapters": [
        877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Star Lord Wan Xiang’s complete star path inheritance, star cloud grindstone, star snake rope, and six illusion star bodies all use Star Mark, Star Shoot, and Starlight as cores and complement each other. Position star swap lets him vanish and take an illusion body’s place; the replaced body disappears, then he can recreate illusion bodies up to the field maximum again. The two moves work together and leave Hui Feng Zi and He Lang Zi without a quick counter.",
      "chapters": [
        877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
        "move_star_cloud_grindstone",
        "move_star_snake_rope",
        "gu_star_mark_immortal_gu",
        "gu_star_shoot_immortal_gu",
        "gu_starlight_immortal_gu",
        "char_hui_feng_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng disrupts or resists Lang Ya land spirit’s attacks; the land spirit’s fighting wisdom is very low. Fang Yuan’s coordination of six illusion star bodies with position star swap is much better, and the land spirit has much to learn.",
      "chapters": [
        881
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coordination-and-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With only those three star path Immortal Gu he can still run four star path killer moves by rotating the cores, including this one.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coordination-and-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Eastern Sea pursuers he splits into six directions with the move, then uses position star swap to shift his true body and leave after a short counterattack.",
      "chapters": [
        896
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coordination-and-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the six star path immortal killer moves he controls, he counts this one with star cloud grindstone, star snake rope, position star swap, star fire escape, and projected star thought.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coordination-and-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He also uses it to encircle a yaksha octopus after trapping another.",
      "chapters": [
        932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coordination-and-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
